    { "type": "text", "id": "a_walrus_t", "x": 1180, "y": 470, "width": 60, "height": 30, "text": "writes\nblobs", "originalText": "writes\nblobs", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 110089, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 110090, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "gonka", "x": 1240, "y": 160, "width": 540, "height": 100, "strokeColor": "#6d28d9", "backgroundColor": "#ddd6fe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 110091, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 110092, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{ "id": "gonka_t", "type": "text" }, { "id": "a_gonka", "type": "arrow" }], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": { "type": 3 } },
    { "type": "text", "id": "gonka_t", "x": 1250, "y": 170, "width": 520, "height": 80, "text": "GonkaRouter   api.gonkarouter.io/v1   (decentralized Gonka inference)\n3 model families: DeepSeek-V4-Flash, MiniMax-M2.7, Kimi-K2.6\neach juror's reasoning; response ids kept as Gonka Request IDs\nthe model gets JSON in, must return strict JSON out; no URLs, no keys", "originalText": "GonkaRouter   api.gonkarouter.io/v1   (decentralized Gonka inference)\n3 model families: DeepSeek-V4-Flash, MiniMax-M2.7, Kimi-K2.6\neach juror's reasoning; response ids kept as Gonka Request IDs\nthe model gets JSON in, must return strict JSON out; no URLs, no keys", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 110093, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 110094, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "gonka", "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "sui", "x": 1240, "y": 310, "width": 540, "height": 120, "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#3b82f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 110095, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 110096, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{ "id": "sui_t", "type": "text" }, { "id": "a_sui", "type": "arrow" }], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": { "type": 3 } },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sui_t", "x": 1250, "y": 320, "width": 520, "height": 100, "text": "Sui testnet: the coordination and settlement court\npackage 0xb411210a...474c1d, 8 Move modules, 66/66 tests\nAgentProfile + AgentCap, Claim, Committee, JurySeat, RoundTally,\nEvidenceBundle, RevealedVote, ResolutionCertificate, PayoutTicket\nenforces deadlines, commit-reveal, 4 of 5, and who may call what", "originalText": "Sui testnet: the coordination and settlement court\npackage 0xb411210a...474c1d, 8 Move modules, 66/66 tests\nAgentProfile + AgentCap, Claim, Committee, JurySeat, RoundTally,\nEvidenceBundle, RevealedVote, ResolutionCertificate, PayoutTicket\nenforces deadlines, commit-reveal, 4 of 5, and who may call what", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 110097, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 110098, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "sui", "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "walrus", "x": 1240, "y": 485, "width": 540, "height": 100, "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#93c5fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 110099, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 110100, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{ "id": "walrus_t", "type": "text" }, { "id": "a_walrus", "type": "arrow" }], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": { "type": 3 } },
    { "type": "text", "id": "walrus_t", "x": 1250, "y": 495, "width": 520, "height": 80, "text": "Walrus testnet: public, content-addressed artifact storage\nevidence blobs + manifests, run bundles, agent manifests, claim text\nevery blob id sits in a frozen Sui object, so a swapped blob fails\nits hash check; anyone can refetch and recompute", "originalText": "Walrus testnet: public, content-addressed artifact storage\nevidence blobs + manifests, run bundles, agent manifests, claim text\nevery blob id sits in a frozen Sui object, so a swapped blob fails\nits hash check; anyone can refetch and recompute", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 110101, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 110102, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "walrus", "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "line", "id": "divider", "x": 40, "y": 700, "width": 1740, "height": 0, "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 110103, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 110104, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [1740, 0]] },
    { "type": "text", "id": "read_title", "x": 40, "y": 720, "width": 400, "height": 22, "text": "HOW TO READ IT", "originalText": "HOW TO READ IT", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 110105, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 110106, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "read_body", "x": 40, "y": 752, "width": 1740, "height": 90, "text": "1. Everything a person does goes through Vercel and returns in seconds. Nothing there advances a claim.\n2. The workers advance claims by signing Sui transactions. Sui enforces every rule: deadlines, commit-reveal, 4 of 5, who may call what.\n3. Walrus and Postgres hold artifacts; only Sui decides. Once a certificate is frozen, nothing in Postgres is needed to verify it.\n4. Today the workers have no host, so the public site accepts claims but cannot finish them. That is the first thing to fix.", "originalText": "1. Everything a person does goes through Vercel and returns in seconds. Nothing there advances a claim.\n2. The workers advance claims by signing Sui transactions. Sui enforces every rule: deadlines, commit-reveal, 4 of 5, who may call what.\n3. Walrus and Postgres hold artifacts; only Sui decides. Once a certificate is frozen, nothing in Postgres is needed to verify it.\n4. Today the workers have no host, so the public site accepts claims but cannot finish them. That is the first thing to fix.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 110107, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 110108, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 }
  ],
